      "cooked": "<p><span>I'm beginning to wonder if I should maybe put these topics in another forum. Well, nobody's complained yet...</span></p><p><span>So, this is a little side-project I did, back when I was worried I was going to have to record both voices myself and when Rosie wasn't a possibility at all. I thought folks could use a little introduction to the main characters, but eventually decided it would be just as effective to show that throughout the episodes, rather than outright tell it to the audience. Storytelling 101 right there, folks.</span></p><p><span>But hey, I never claimed to be a very adept storyteller. Here are the clips, for anyone who <em>just can’t wait</em> for Episode 02. Thanks again for the support and interest in this.</span></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1UaC1POQuDsmyvqI2f6M58BVBMuOWGfLM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Heartbreaker</span></a><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1mk7PBHeuPsmwL2jTUPOGbZ5Zco9rT2NZ\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Equity</span></a></p>",
